[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13882.469, "timestamp": "03:51:22", "text": "杀。啊，我忘了用沙鹰了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13885.99, "timestamp": "03:51:25", "text": "奇怪的疼痛。好了，我们走吧。那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13900.29, "timestamp": "03:51:40", "text": "嗯？我拿到了11个人头。我的天哪，这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13905.79, "timestamp": "03:51:45", "text": "最有价值球员。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13909.03, "timestamp": "03:51:49", "text": "嗯，所以我们需要的事件是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13912.229, "timestamp": "03:51:52", "text": "完整版就是这样。我确实玩了一会儿，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13916.15, "timestamp": "03:51:56", "text": "我需要把剩下的这两个也弄到手。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13918.429, "timestamp": "03:51:58", "text": "猜猜这两个"}]